>Dear All,
>
>Does any one have the ready procedure to capture the source data that in
>column format into field.
>
>For example :
>
>Month    A sales    B sales    C sales
>Feb       100 K       200 K      200 K
>Mar       100 K       300 K
>
>I want to capture  field A_total  = X + Y where X = 100K and Y = 100K.
