What OS, What language, what format of input,

This might work on unix (No machine at home to try it on)
If you want VMS or RSX11 then somebody else will have to help.

Or you could buy a spread-sheet program.

#!/bin/sh
DATA_FILE=$1
grep -v '^Month' $DATA_FILE | \
awk 'BEGIN   {total=0} 
     $3=="K" {total =total +(1000 * $2) ; $2=0}
             {total=total+$2} 
     END{print total / 1000 , "K"}'






