> that's it's client base has been steadily declining and that the
> operating system will probably be gone entirely in a just a few years.
> What are some of your views?

No product that delivers gross margins in excess of 50 percent is on the
way out.

No product that supports a user base of ~10M people is on the way out.

CPQ just released a five-year roadmap for OVMS (SKC subscribers have
seen this already, of course).

