> crossed and give the 800MHz pieces the thumbs-up, too, but the 1GHz?

1GHz in volume by year's end? I wouldn't bet on it, but you never know.
667MHz is being produced now; goal is 700MHz EV67 for TLaser this
summer, 767MHz EV67 for WF before the end of the year. If EV68 ships
before year's end the 1GHz is conceivably attainable, although EV68 will
start at ~800MHz.

