Well, there certainly *was* a DECUS Russia.  I remember because I was a
guest speaker at its first annual symposium, which was held in Protvino, about
100 km south of Moscow (the town did not exist on many maps since it was
formerly a secret research town built over a nuclear particle accelerator.
