  If you go looking for the OpenVMS Software Product Description,
  and particularly for the SPD for OpenVMS V7.1-2 or V7.2, please 
  be aware of the following...

  For many years, OpenVMS VAX has used SPD 25.01...

  With OpenVMS Alpha, SPD 41.87 came into existance...

  With more recent OpenVMS Alpha versions, we have consolidated the 
  OpenVMS Alpha SPD into the OpenVMS VAX SPD, and have used SPD 25.01 
  for both platforms -- this is our prefered approach...

  That said, just recently, SPD 41.87 has reappeared as the OpenVMS
  Alpha V7.1-2 SPD, while SPD 25.01 is being used as the OpenVMS VAX 
  and OpenVMS Alpha V7.2 SPD.  This is admittedly somewhat confusing, 
  but is being done to keep the list of supported hardware clear.

  When the dust settles, we hope to be back to (just) SPD 25.01 for 
  future releases.

 -------------------------- pure personal opinion ---------------------------
