I would suggest buying used drives from someone who has upgraded for
reasons of speed.  The CD/R SCSI commands are not standardized, so
they change with each model.  As a result, Infoserver has a hardcoded
table of models it will support.

Having both a Sony CDW900E (old) and a Sony CDU926S, I would choose
the former any day of the week.

