Thanks very much for your help; I'm an idiot.

sleep(1) suspends my process; so if I do

RPCC-and-add-the-two-halves
sleep(1)
RPCC-and-add-the-two-halves
Find-the-difference

I'm timing how long it takes to call sleep(1), not an interval of one
second.

