|!Y4!MN0!D0|!H04!M0!S0!C2| as input fomat in init-string, then call
lib$convert_date_string to convert your date to OpenVMS internal format.

at this point, you can do any date/time computation available in RTL.

to write your computed date:

first call lib$init_date_time_context with |!Y4!MN0!D0|| as init-string but
for output format, then call lib$format_date_time to convert the OpenVMS
internal date format back to ascii string.

feel free to email if you want more info.
Pierre

