glass cylinder filled with I believe water and ether. This glass cylinder was mounted on
top of the chip.  The heat from the chip would cause a bubble to form in the water/ether
that would then cause it to splash up inside the cylinder.  The glass cylinder was
enclosed in a metal cover with lots of fins.

