:System Serial Number = ayxxxxxxxxx     (serial number hidden)

  Incorrect.

  This capability is not available on all systems, and I'd also
  tend to not assume it matched the sticker on the enclosure...

  The serial number referenced in the license agreement is the one 
  from the sticker on the back or bottom of the system enclosure.

  Check with the DECUS folks for what to use if you don't have the 
  enclosure -- I'd tend to assume they'd then be looking for the 
  serial number sticker on the CPU module (the first CPU, if SMP).
  (This is a hobbyist license; this should not be unexpected...)

  Please ask the DECUS folks to add text to the licensing website 
  indicating exactly what serial number they are looking for, and 
  (in general terms) where to look for the sticker.

